 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1030) 'See `DETAILS.md` for the component table, the two runtimes, and why bf16 is the ceiling while GGUF is the floor.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1030) '**WITHDRAWN 2026-08-29 as a deployment plan, kept as a component map.** RFD66606-1166 dropped See-Through from the candidate ranking on licensing: the checkpoints named below state no licence, and the depth component derives from an OpenRAIL++-M model. The table remains accurate about what the project is made of and is no longer a plan to run it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1030) 'RFD66606-1006 records the layer decomposition design. RFD66606-1019 selects the same ggml runtime for the Elixir core. RFD66606-1025 carries the single catalog row that this RFD breaks down.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

