2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-1030) 'Two runtimes
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-1030) 'Replicate runs the Cog model from RFD66606-1006, in bf16. There is no DGX, per RFD66606-1027 and RFD66606-1036. see-through.cpp runs the same models on a local machine, with ggml and a Vulkan backend. It reads GGUF weights and writes a layered PSD. It needs no Replicate connection, and it uses the Apache 2.0 license.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-1030) 'bf16 is the ceiling, and GGUF is the floor
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-1030) 'The local runtime does not use bf16. Q4_K_M holds one parameter in about 0.55 bytes, thus the same nine components need about 2.7 GB. Plan the Replicate path against 9.82 GB. Plan the local path against 2.7 GB.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-1030) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1030  1 LINE
 Text:Written

